$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General Procedure for 53e and 53f. To a stirred mixture of 52d (9.30 g,
26.2 mmol (for 53f)) or 52d (3.02 g, 8.51 mmol, 53e synthesis), K2CO3
(14.49 g, 10.49 mmol, 0.4 equiv (for 53f)), or Na2CO3 (4.71 g, 44.4 mmol,
53e synthesis), Pd(dppf)2Cl2 (0.1 equiv), in dry DMF (0.15 M), purged
with N2 was added phenylboronic acid (2.0 equiv), and the mixture was
heated to 100 °C. After 2.5 h the mixture was diluted with EtOAc, washed
with water, brine, dried over MgSO4, filtered, and concentrated to give a
crude product.
2-((S)-1-(8-Fluoro-2-(3-fluorophenyl)quinolin-3-yl)ethyl)-isoindoline-1,3-dione
(53e). Recrystallization was from EtOAc/ hexanes. Yield 70% (2.45 g, 5.91
mmol). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ ppm 8.63 (1 H, s), 7.66-7.75 (5 H, m),
7.53 (1 H, td, J = 7.9, 4.9 Hz), 7.42 (1 H, ddd, J = 10.4, 7.8, 1.4 Hz),
7.35 (1 H, td, J = 7.9, 5.7 Hz), 7.21 (1 H, dt, J = 7.7, 1.2 Hz),
7.04-7.14 (2 H, m), 5.80 (1 H, q, J = 7.0 Hz), 1.90 (3 H, d, J = 7.0 Hz).
Mass spectrum (ESI) m/e = 415.0 (M + l).
